Implement DebugLine/DebugNoLine for NonSemantic.Shader.DebugInfo.100 and NonSemantic.Shader.DebugInfo.200.
Updated test/DebugInfo/NonSemantic/Shader200/DebugInfoStringType.ll to test these changes.
